          <p>Software engineer building since 2022 in Python, TypeScript, Node.js and React, with direct experience training, evaluating and benchmarking neural models on PyTorch and CUDA. I review and debug code carefully, judge model output against objective metrics, record negative results instead of shipping unproven claims, and write the tests and documentation that make systems maintainable. I have shipped three live products end to end and work well independently and remotely.</p>
