            <p>Built a compliance-first trading sandbox with authenticated workflows, market research, dedicated charts, a TradingView workspace and MT5 demo onboarding, while keeping real funds and live execution disabled ahead of licensing.</p>
            <div class="project-links"><a href="https://bitcoin-america.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Live sandbox ↗</a><a href="/projects/gandj">Case study ↗</a></div>
